The Sun Is Shrinking — a Pixel Countdown Science film · credits & licences

ORIGINAL (made for this film, by code in this folder)
- All pixel art: the Sun character and its cut-away, Earth, pyramids, the night sky (sun.js, main.js).
- Captions and counters (font.js). Music and sound effects synthesised with numpy (mix.py); the end melody is original.

